{"title":"Career Roadmap · Trade Analyst","role":"Trade Analyst","summary":"A Trade Analyst analyzes international trade transactions, import/export data, markets, tariffs, trade regulations, logistics costs, currencies, suppliers, customers, and trade performance to support business decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Foreign Trade / International Business"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Trade Analyst analyzes international trade transactions, import/export data, markets, tariffs, trade regulations, logistics costs, currencies, suppliers, customers, and trade performance to support business decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com – Foreign Trade / International Business graduate, this is a strong and directly aligned career pathway. The student should combine commerce fundamentals with international trade procedures, customs, EXIM documentation, trade finance, Excel, data analytics, supply-chain concepts, and international business knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Trade Analyst roles can exist across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Export/import companies"},{"text":"Trading houses"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Logistics and freight companies"},{"text":"Banks and trade-finance teams"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Market-intelligence organizations"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Government/public-sector trade organizations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile combines trade domain expertise + analytics + international business + technology."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Trade Foundation & Entry"},{"text":"EXIM Intern → Trade/Export Executive → Junior Trade Analyst"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Trade Analytics & Operations"},{"text":"Trade Analyst → Senior Trade Analyst / Trade Operations Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Strategic Trade"},{"text":"Trade Intelligence / Supply Chain / International Business Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Leadership & Advisory"},{"text":"Trade Strategy Lead / International Business Head / Trade Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce & International Business Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in commerce before specializing in trade."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"International business"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Management principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"International business fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Globalization"},{"text":"International markets"},{"text":"Imports"},{"text":"Exports"},{"text":"Multinational companies"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"International trade agreements"},{"text":"Trade barriers"},{"text":"Tariffs"},{"text":"Non-tariff barriers"},{"text":"Balance of trade"},{"text":"Balance of payments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Export-Import Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important stage for developing practical trade knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Import/Export Process"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Buyer / Seller","Trade Negotiation","Purchase / Sales Contract","Payment Terms","Documentation","Shipping","Customs","Delivery","Payment / Settlement"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commercial invoice"},{"text":"Proforma invoice"},{"text":"Packing list"},{"text":"Bill of lading"},{"text":"Air waybill"},{"text":"Certificate of origin"},{"text":"Insurance documents"},{"text":"Shipping bill"},{"text":"Bill of entry"},{"text":"Letter of credit"},{"text":"Purchase order"},{"text":"Export declaration"},{"text":"Inspection certificates"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Incoterms"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the major Incoterms® and understand how they affect responsibility, cost, and risk between buyer and seller."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EXW"},{"text":"FCA"},{"text":"FOB"},{"text":"CFR"},{"text":"CIF"},{"text":"CPT"},{"text":"CIP"},{"text":"DAP"},{"text":"DPU"},{"text":"DDP"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not simply memorize the abbreviations. Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who Pays?"},{"type":"p","text":"Who Arranges Transport?"},{"type":"p","text":"Who Bears Risk?"},{"type":"p","text":"Where Does Delivery Occur?"},{"type":"p","text":"Who Handles Customs?"},{"type":"p","text":"Incoterms are periodically updated, so practical work should use the currently applicable version."},{"type":"h","text":"Customs Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs duty"},{"text":"Import duty"},{"text":"Export procedures"},{"text":"HS codes"},{"text":"Tariff classification"},{"text":"Customs valuation"},{"text":"Country of origin"},{"text":"Import documentation"},{"text":"Export documentation"},{"text":"Restricted/prohibited goods"},{"text":"Customs clearance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HS Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how products are classified for international trade."},{"type":"p","text":"A Trade Analyst should be able to investigate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Product Description","HS Classification","Applicable Duty","Trade Restrictions","Landed Cost"]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact classification should always be verified using the applicable official tariff/customs sources rather than assumed from a generic product description."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Trade Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade finance is an important differentiator for a B.Com graduate."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Payment methods"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advance payment"},{"text":"Open account"},{"text":"Documentary collection"},{"text":"Letter of credit"},{"text":"Documentary credit"},{"text":"Bank guarantees"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Foreign exchange"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exchange rates"},{"text":"Currency conversion"},{"text":"Spot rates"},{"text":"Forward contracts"},{"text":"Currency risk"},{"text":"Hedging fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Letter of Credit"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the basic process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Importer","Importer Bank","Letter of Credit","Exporter Bank","Exporter","Shipment + Documents","Bank Document Verification","Payment"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand the commercial workflow without attempting to provide regulated financial advice."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Trade Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Now move from trade operations into analytical decision-making."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Pivot Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import volumes"},{"text":"Export volumes"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Country performance"},{"text":"Shipping costs"},{"text":"Trade margins"},{"text":"Duties"},{"text":"Exchange-rate impact"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Trade Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product category"},{"text":"Quantity"},{"text":"Value"},{"text":"Unit price"},{"text":"HS code"},{"text":"Duty"},{"text":"Margin"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Country level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import country"},{"text":"Export destination"},{"text":"Trade volume"},{"text":"Trade value"},{"text":"Growth rate"},{"text":"Market share"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier/customer level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier concentration"},{"text":"Customer concentration"},{"text":"Purchase price"},{"text":"Sales price"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Delivery performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Key Trade Metrics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to calculate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Trade growth"},{"type":"p","text":"Growth % ="},{"type":"p","text":"(Current Value − Previous Value)"},{"type":"p","text":"÷ Previous Value × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Trade balance"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade Balance ="},{"type":"p","text":"Exports − Imports"},{"type":"h","text":"Import dependency"},{"type":"p","text":"Measure how dependent the business is on specific imported products, suppliers, or countries."},{"type":"h","text":"Landed cost"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Freight"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Customs Duty"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Taxes/Charges"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Handling"},{"type":"p","text":"="},{"type":"p","text":"Landed Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact calculation varies by transaction and tax/customs treatment."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Supply Chain & Logistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade analysis is closely connected with logistics."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight forwarding"},{"text":"Shipping"},{"text":"Air cargo"},{"text":"Sea freight"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Customs clearance"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Transit time"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Logistics costs"},{"text":"Supply-chain risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Factory","Port","International Transport","Customs","Warehouse","Customer"]},{"type":"p","text":"A Trade Analyst should be able to identify where delays and additional costs occur."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Market Intelligence & Strategic Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Com is a 3-year program, compress this stage into the final semester and internship period."},{"type":"h","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Market growth"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Import trends"},{"text":"Export trends"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Tariffs"},{"text":"Regulations"},{"text":"Country risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A company wants to export an Indian product to a new market."},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst should investigate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market Size","Demand","Competitors","Import Duties","Regulations","Logistics Cost","Currency Risk","Landed Cost","Expected Margin","Market Opportunity"]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analytics Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern Trade Analyst should develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Database"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python/pandas basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau optional"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use these for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trade dashboards"},{"text":"Country analysis"},{"text":"Supplier analysis"},{"text":"Pricing trends"},{"text":"Market intelligence"},{"text":"Logistics performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Import/Export Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dataset containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product"},{"text":"HS code"},{"text":"Country"},{"text":"Import/export"},{"text":"Quantity"},{"text":"Value"},{"text":"Duty"},{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Date"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import/export trends"},{"text":"Country performance"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Growth rates"},{"text":"Trade value"},{"text":"Top trading partners"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Landed Cost Calculator"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel model calculating:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Freight"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Duty"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Other Charges"},{"type":"p","text":"="},{"type":"p","text":"Landed Cost"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare suppliers and countries based on total landed cost."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Export Market Selection"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a hypothetical Indian product and compare multiple destination markets."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Import volume"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Tariffs"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Currency"},{"text":"Regulatory requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a final market-ranking dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Supplier Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier"},{"text":"Country"},{"text":"Order volume"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"On-time delivery"},{"text":"Defects"},{"text":"Freight cost"},{"text":"Payment terms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a supplier-performance scorecard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Trade Intelligence Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an end-to-end analytical system:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Data","Data Cleaning","SQL / Python","Trade Analysis","Market Intelligence","Power BI","Business Recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"This should be the student's strongest portfolio project."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start gaining practical exposure during the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trade Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Export Intern"},{"text":"Import Intern"},{"text":"EXIM Intern"},{"text":"International Business Intern"},{"text":"Trade Operations Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Intern"},{"text":"Logistics Intern"},{"text":"Market Research Intern"},{"text":"Trade Finance Intern"},{"text":"Procurement Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant organizations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Export companies"},{"text":"Import companies"},{"text":"Trading houses"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Freight forwarders"},{"text":"Logistics companies"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Trade-finance departments"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Market-intelligence companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest internship is one involving real trade documentation, market analysis, logistics data, customs processes, or international transaction analysis."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Trade"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trade Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Trade Analyst"},{"text":"Trade Operations Executive"},{"text":"Export Executive"},{"text":"Import Executive"},{"text":"EXIM Executive"},{"text":"International Trade Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Business Executive"},{"text":"Business Development Executive"},{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"International Sales Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Logistics Analyst"},{"text":"Supply Chain Analyst"},{"text":"Procurement Analyst"},{"text":"Import/Export Coordinator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Banking"},{"type":"p","text":"With additional banking/trade-finance knowledge:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trade Finance Associate"},{"text":"Trade Operations Associate"},{"text":"Letter of Credit Processing Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Trade analysis"},{"text":"International trade"}],[{"text":"EXIM operations"},{"text":"Import/export procedures"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Commercial & shipping documents"}],[{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"HS codes, duties, clearance"}],[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Market intelligence"}],[{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Excel + accounting"}],[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI"}],[{"text":"Trade finance"},{"text":"LC, payment methods"}],[{"text":"FX"},{"text":"Currency fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Freight + shipping"}],[{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Landed-cost modeling"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Power BI"}],[{"text":"Database analysis"},{"text":"SQL"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Business communication"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary learning includes:"},{"type":"h","text":"International Trade"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Export/import procedures"},{"text":"International trade documentation"},{"text":"Incoterms"},{"text":"Customs fundamentals"},{"text":"Trade compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trade finance"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"Financial modeling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Logistics fundamentals"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Supply-chain analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are useful, but actual EXIM documentation and trade-analysis experience should be prioritized."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not mandatory for an entry-level Trade Analyst."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Com International Business"},{"text":"M.Com Foreign Trade"},{"text":"MBA International Business"},{"text":"MBA Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"MBA Logistics"},{"text":"Master's in International Business"},{"text":"Master's in Supply Chain Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong combinations"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Trade Analyst","Senior Trade Analyst","International Business Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Trade Analyst","Supply Chain Analytics","Supply Chain Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","Trade Operations","Trade Finance","Banking/Financial Services"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Trade Intelligence"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import/export data"},{"text":"Market trends"},{"text":"Country analysis"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Trade policy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Analyst","Senior Trade Analyst","Trade Intelligence Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Trade Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"Trade regulations"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Product classification"},{"text":"Sanctions/export-control awareness"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Analyst","Trade Compliance Analyst","Trade Compliance Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Trade Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Letters of credit"},{"text":"Bank guarantees"},{"text":"Documentary collections"},{"text":"International payments"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Operations Associate","Trade Finance Analyst","Trade Finance Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Supply Chain Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Supplier performance"},{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Cost optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Analyst","Supply Chain Analyst","Senior Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"5. International Business Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market entry"},{"text":"Country selection"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"International expansion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Analyst","International Business Analyst","Strategy Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Trade analytics route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com – Foreign Trade / International Business","Trade Intern","Trade Analyst","Senior Trade Analyst","Trade Intelligence Lead","Trade Strategy Manager","International Business Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Supply-chain route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Analyst","Supply Chain Analyst","Senior Supply Chain Analyst","Supply Chain Manager","Supply Chain Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Trade-finance route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Trade Operations Associate","Trade Finance Analyst","Senior Trade Finance Analyst","Trade Finance Manager","Trade Finance Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"International trade is increasingly becoming data- and technology-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Important areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered trade intelligence"},{"text":"Automated document processing"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital trade documentation"},{"text":"Blockchain-based trade documentation"},{"text":"Supply-chain visibility platforms"},{"text":"Predictive logistics"},{"text":"AI demand forecasting"},{"text":"Trade-risk analytics"},{"text":"Automated customs compliance"},{"text":"Real-time shipment tracking"},{"text":"Digital trade finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready Trade Analyst should understand how technology can reduce manual documentation and improve cost analysis, compliance, forecasting, and market intelligence."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Trade"},{"type":"p","text":"International Trade"},{"type":"p","text":"EXIM Procedures"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Incoterms"},{"type":"p","text":"Customs"},{"type":"p","text":"HS Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade Compliance"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Trade Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Letters of Credit"},{"type":"p","text":"Foreign Exchange"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Landed Cost"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Power Query"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Python/pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Market Research"},{"type":"p","text":"International Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Competitive Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Country Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Business Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Supply Chain"},{"type":"p","text":"Logistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Procurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Supplier Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Freight"},{"type":"p","text":"Inventory"},{"type":"p","text":"Supply Chain Risk"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to analyze a hypothetical international trade opportunity:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Target Market","Trade Data","HS Classification","Tariff / Regulatory Review","Supplier & Logistics Cost","Currency Impact","Landed Cost","Market Demand","Expected Margin","Trade Recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally graduate with strong EXIM knowledge, practical documentation skills, advanced Excel, Power BI, basic SQL, trade-finance fundamentals, and at least one trade/supply-chain internship."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com – Foreign Trade / International Business → Trade Analyst is a strong and directly aligned pathway. The core employability combination is International Trade + EXIM Documentation + Customs Fundamentals + Excel + Power BI + Market Research + Trade Finance."},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term growth, the student should avoid remaining limited to documentation and routine export/import coordination. A stronger career strategy is to develop expertise in trade intelligence, trade compliance, trade finance, supply-chain analytics, or international business strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"The most future-ready profile combines international trade knowledge + data analytics + financial understanding + supply-chain technology, creating a progression from Trade Analyst → Senior Trade Analyst → Trade Intelligence/Strategy Lead → International Business or Trade Management."}]}]}